#: b2/config/config.cpp:93
msgid "An action can be associated to a double click of the menu button. Leave it to none if in doubt."
msgstr "Du kannst den Dubbelklick op den Menüknoop en Akschoon toornen. Laat dat op \"Nix doon\", wenn Du nich seker büst."

#. +> trunk stable
#: kde2/config/config.cpp:57
msgid "Draw titlebar &stipple effect"
msgstr "&Punktmuster op Titelbalken"

